79 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 58 0 R
/E (Queen maintains a sequential blockchain in which each block contains a block height, timestamp, mining difficulty, Merkle root, transaction list, reference to the previous block, nonce, and the resulting block hash. Each transaction is identified by a transaction identifier \(TXID\), while transaction outputs are maintained as unspent transaction outputs \(UTXOs\) until they are consumed by a subsequent transaction. A transaction references an existing UTXO through its transaction identifier and output index \(vout\). When a valid transaction is applied, its referenced inputs are marked as spent and its outputs are added to the UTXO set. The transaction fee is determined from the difference between the total input value and the total output value.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
