/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 60 0 R
/E (Queen uses a UTXO-based transaction model in which transaction inputs reference previously created unspent transaction outputs and transaction outputs create new spendable outputs. Each input identifies the previous transaction through its TXID and specifies the corresponding output index \(vout\). The node checks that every referenced UTXO exists and has not already been spent before accepting the transaction. The public key contained in the input is used to derive the corresponding address, which must match the address of the referenced UTXO. The transaction is then authenticated by verifying its digital signature against the transaction payload.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [1]
>>
