/E (Queen was tested by submitting both valid and invalid blockchain data to the validation system. The tests include invalid transactions, invalid signatures, incorrect transaction identifiers, invalid UTXO references, duplicate or already- spent inputs, incorrect Merkle roots, invalid Proof-of-Work, and inconsistent chain data. Additional tests were performed on competing chain conditions to verify that nodes do not simply accept a chain based on its length. These tests are used to confirm that invalid data is rejected and that valid blockchain data can be independently verified by participating nodes.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [3]
